  "scope": "Three Ward maps only; nine purpose-led nonrectangular landmark rooms, three new broad shared connections, one optional unsealed accepted-pickup ambush per map, authored navigation/feedback. Human pacing remains review, no automatic20\u201325minute claim.",
  "preserve": [
    "six later playable maps/catalog/order",
    "all original art/audio/music/weapon/player/enemy-AI/gore bytes",
    "existing objective prerequisites and8campaign carries",
    "all actor stable IDs/types/counts64/76/84",
    "all existing v13sharedcourts/slots/both-feedshutters/anchor order/CP policy",
    "main-route supply totals and caps; optional rewards unchanged"
  ],
  "contracts": {
    "schema": "Keep objective design_version13 compatibility; add layout_revision14 to authored source/report/root metadata, no deceptive replacement of v13 historical evidence.",
    "room_outline": "outline_xz local simple CCW polygon, unchanged centre/floor/bounding size, actual closed floor/roof convex decomposition and boundary walls; never convex-fill concave cutout. Native world-projected materials on every exposed face.",
    "room_detection": "Room metadata footprint_xz localPackedVector2Array; Stage.room_at polygon inclusion beforeoldAABB. PublishworldXZ footprint inmap_rooms forshapedrooms. Root implements accuratepolygonfullmap/minimap rendering in ward_automap.gd+industrial_hud_v8.gd; rect isbounding envelope only, existinglegacyrectangularpath unchanged.",
    "mouths": "All existing cardinal centre mouths and mandatory/CP/supply approaches preserved; use actual boundary-edge cuts. No new traversable graph edges or sequence skips.",
    "fitting": "Only named corner prop moves below plus explicitly reported minimal shell-dependent fixture/roof/trim fits. Preserve semantic prop type/count/IDs; complete exact footprint audit. Reject shape if fitting requires unplanned gameplay relocation. New closet requires full-width physical front partition/header with6m door, outerroom walls as sides/back, closed textured roof atfloor+3.8; no transparent/invisible occlusion.",
    "enemy_nav": "Unchanged enemy code; preserve clear original centre routes. Extra flank routes are player choices, not coordinated enemy flanking.",
    "ambush": "Profile encounter activation=pickup, pickup_id exactstableid, requires explicit[], arena_id unique, release_doors list optional; no exit/control prerequisites use completion. Existing two actors assigned authored group/positions/activation_room; release physical closet door only after accepted reward mutation, once. Full ammo item stays uncollected/noactivation. No main exit sealing, no new pickups/supplies/enemy count. Snapshot existingflags/collected/arena_active/doorpose/enemies owns persistence; restore never replays pickup/attack/audio.",
    "source_ownership": "Construction owns author generator/masterroomdata/scenes/layout/routes/objective text/data and MD/SVG. Runtime owns StageLevel only plus optional new mesh helper if construction requests. QA owns opt-in tests/evidence. Root owns contracts/research/captures/package/Git. Root additionally owns two read-only map renderers toshow actualfootprints; no otherHUDbehavior/style change.",
    "checkpoint_restore_amendment": "Native optional-door test proved a pending AnimatableBody3D physics pose could overwrite a same-world snapshot teleport on the next tick. Permit only checkpoint restore synchronization of the real physics body transform, preserving schema, safety, logical state and fresh-world Continue ownership."
  },
